WEBVTT

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:11.630
The power of chaos...is rampaging inside my body...!

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.230
It's trying to completely erase my existence...!

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:24.100
But you... I will...

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.840
In order to defeat Astral...!

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.310
Even if my body's torn apart...

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:36.150
I will make this power mine!

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.420
I have surpassed Astral!

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.830
No, I have surpassed the power of <i>all creation</i>!

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:47.960
I am... God!

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.100
The seven Numbers of the ruins...

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.940
The legends left behind in those ruins

00:00:54.940 --> 00:01:00.880
are stories from when the
 Seven Barian Emperors were human...

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:03.570
And one of those ruins

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:09.350
showed me Shark and Rio among the legend I saw in the labyrinth at the bottom of the ocean.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.620
Are those two really...?

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:15.160
What is this feeling...?

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:17.130
Could it be...?!

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.780
What the hell?!

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:36.730
Th-This is...!

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:44.050
Just what the hell is going on here?!

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:51.090
It's him. Number 96. He has started to move.

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:51.990
What?!

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:55.610
He is attacking the Astral World.

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:58.630
And the aftermath of that will affect this world as well.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:04.070
Now, Vector... You must search for him immediately.

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:07.510
I shall destroy everything!

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:12.350
Everything in the entire world!

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:45.570
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:48.620
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:56.080
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.630
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:04.510
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:10.850
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:14.060
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.940
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:21.570
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:24.650
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:33.120
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.120
Yuma. Yuma!

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:56.090
"Three Worlds on the Verge of Destruction! Ultimate Rampage - Numbers 96!!"

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.210
Huh? What is it?

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.430
There's something strange going on in the Astral World.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.430
Huh? What? In the Astral World?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.270
That is not all. Most likely...

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:13.520
<i>Abnormal phenomenon has occurred all over the world.</i>

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.190
<i>Volcanoes that dormant volcanic activity erupted.</i>

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:20.230
<i>Auroras were observed in all countries of the world, and drift ice is blocking the coast...</i>

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:21.940
Sudden volcano eruptions...

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.780
Southern auroras appearing in places they don't belong... Sudden islands of icebergs...

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.700
Just what in the world is going on out there?

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.370
S-Sis, what's this?

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.790
You're too carefree again! There's commotion all over the world this morning!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.460
Now, it's time to cover it!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.300
As I figured...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.340
Astral?

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:45.510
The phenomenon occurring in the Astral World are also occurring in the human world.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.010
It would seem they are related.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.470
This is most likely...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:56.440
Astral, you should be fully aware of my power!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:01.860
The time has arrived! I will absorb him and dominate this world!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:14.000
Why, Rio...? Why did you once again...?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.170
Just what will we...?

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:19.340
Darkness...

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.500
Rio?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.170
A massive darkness is...

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:28.390
The darkness will... pull Yuma in...

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.850
What did you say? You mean Yuma?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.770
The curtain of the tragedy is rising...

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:36.560
Yuma!

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:42.230
But Yuma... Rio-<i>san</i> hasn't regained consciousness since then.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:43.030
I know.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:47.490
But she was always predicting stuff about the Barians even when she wasn't conscious.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.450
That's why this time too...

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:55.410
Ah! She may suddenly just open here eyes and wake up!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.710
Anyway, I'm worried about Shark.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:00.460
Shark?

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:01.670
Yeah...

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.380
He's been acting pretty weird since we returned from those ruins.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.380
Almost like he's pondering over something...

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:14.890
Yuma.

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:15.850
Huh?

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:20.690
Shark may have a serious talk with you one of these days.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:23.440
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.690
If he has not told you himself,

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.410
there is nothing I can say right now.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:34.540
You can't say it?
 He's been acting like he's confused.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.870
If that's the case, it's something I think we should talk about...

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:42.130
Even if the consequences bring you great suffering?

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:45.590
Of course! I mean, we're friends!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:46.880
Friends...

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:51.140
Shark!

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:54.720
Yuma!

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.140
Shark...

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.220
Are you okay?

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.060
Okay? What're ya talkin' about?

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.270
What's wrong, Kotori?

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.490
Yuma, up above!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.950
Huh?

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.870
Wh-What the heck's that?

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.120
Is it...?

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:25.250
What tremendous power...!
 It's unlike anything I've ever felt before...!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:35.050
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, there has been a large
 gravitational change in Sector B3-32!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.220
What?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.900
Kaito-<i>sama</i>! I am losing control!

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:05.380
Wh-Where are we?

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:06.170
Yuma!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.670
Ah... Guys!

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.590
Huh? What's Kaito doing here too?

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:15.470
But just what is...?

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:18.760
This place...

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:24.440
I've wanted to see you!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.900
Yuma! And Astral!

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.650
Number 96!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.870
It would seem that some uninvited guests snuck in.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.990
But so be it.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:43.620
I'll take all the Numbers you people are holding.

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.120
Sit tight and wait for your deaths!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:50.050
Number 96, are the phenomenon occurring around the world being caused by you?

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.760
That's right.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.720
Behold!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.390
This is...!

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.560
It's not just the Astral World!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:08.770
My power is influencing both the Barian World and the human world as well!

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:12.490
Are you trying to destroy the Astral World?

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.950
That's right. I plan to obliterate it without a trace!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:20.700
No way...! Isn't the Astral World your birth place?!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.950
And that is why I will obliterate it.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:28.380
As a God, I do not need a birth place!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.590
Tch... God my ass.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:36.550
As a God, I will start by destroying you two!

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.890
Now, the time has come to settle the score!

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:42.600
This will become your tomb!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.640
Wh-What?!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.230
This is...

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.020
The Barian's Sphere Field!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.900
Impossible...! The Barian's field...?!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:57.360
Didn't I tell you? I'm a God!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.030
There is nothing that God can't create!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.160
Not only that...

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.330
Yuma! Astral!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:11.000
Inside here, I alone am an absolutely untouchable existence!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:15.170
All that exists here for you two is pain!

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.090
What a shrewd trick!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:20.260
That's really low! Fight them fair and square!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.680
<i>This field holds nothing but damage...</i>

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.600
<i>And not just for me, but Yuma as well...</i>

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.690
<i>I cannot afford to fall here!</i>

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:37.780
Yuma! Let's win this Duel!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:38.900
Right!

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.990
Now let's Duel!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:44.580
Here goes!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:48.160
Duel Disk, set!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.830
D-Gazer, set!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.220
Duel!!

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:02.550
Astral! Let's settle this!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:07.060
I take the first turn! My turn! Draw!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.770
I Summon Malicevorous Spoon!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:19.320
And I send Malicevorous Knife from my hand to the Graveyard

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:23.070
to Special Summon Malicevorous Fork!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:29.870
Malicevorous Fork can be Special Summoned by sending one Malicevorous Monster to the Graveyard!

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.420
And I activate Malicevorous Spoon's effect!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:38.210
Once per turn, when a Malicevorous Monster is Special Summoned to the field,

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:42.970
I can Special Summon a Level Two Malicevorous Monster from the Graveyard.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.260
Come, Malicevorous Knife!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:49.350
This is... the same as the Duel you guys had last time!

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:54.900
I Overlay the Level Two Malicevorous Spoon, Knife, and Fork!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.900
I use these three Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.530
Xyz Summon!

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:09.450
Show yourself, Number 96! My avatar, Black Mist!

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.420
Now behold the power of God!

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:18.460
I activate the Rank Up Magic, Barian's Force!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.340
I can choose one Xyz Monster on my field

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:27.760
and evolve it into a Chaos Xyz Monster one rank higher!

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:31.390
I Overlay the Rank Two Black Mist!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:35.770
I use this one Monster to rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.940
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:42.650
Appear before us, Chaos Number 96!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:48.240
Ride the jet black winds alongside chaos!

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.620
Black Storm!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:59.630
Astral... The countdown to your destruction has begun.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:03.340
I set one card face-down. Turn end.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:09.680
Yuma... His strategy is to Chaos Xyz right away. There may be something else.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:10.260
Be careful.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:11.560
Right! Let's go!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:15.060
My turn! Draw!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:16.810
Yes!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.900
I Summon Gogogo Golem!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:27.910
Yuma! Special Summon Trouble Diver!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:28.660
Got it.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.330
When I have a Level Four Monster on my field,

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.500
I can Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.710
Come, Trouble Diver!

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:42.340
Yuma got Monsters on his field!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:47.550
I Overlay the Level Four Gogogo Golem and Trouble Diver!

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:52.060
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:53.890
Xyz Summon!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:59.940
Show yourself, Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:02.860
Yes!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:06.530
Yuma!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.780
I-I'm fine, man!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.530
<i>Not good... If this continues...</i>

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:14.160
We're gonna go all out here!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:18.500
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Numeron Force!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:22.670
This card ranks up an Xyz Monster on my field

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.210
and Special Summons a Chaos Xyz!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:30.890
I use the Level Four Aspiring Emperor - Hope to rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.010
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:36.350
Show yourself, Chaos Number 39!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.600
The soul shining with hope!

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:42.440
Become the power to guide everything in the world toward the future!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:46.570
Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray Victory!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:57.080
<i>What? His expression...</i>

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:01.080
And I'll then activate Numeron Force's other effect!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:06.000
It negates the effects of all face-up cards on the field!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:09.930
Now Black Storm can't activate any of its effects!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.430
Wh-What's so funny?!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:20.140
You fell right into my plan nicely.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.100
What did you say?!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:27.730
Astral, you guys are at a huge disadvantage inside this field that damages you.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:32.700
In that case, you'd need to Summon a Chaos Xyz in order to make this a short term battle and escape.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.080
That's what you were thinking.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:36.990
What do you mean?!

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.710
Trap, activate! Chaos Close!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:44.380
When the opponent Special Summons a Chaos Xyz Monster,

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:48.800
all its Overlay Units are sent to the Graveyard!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.220
Its Overlay Units...!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:56.510
And I can choose a Field Spell from my deck and add it to my hand.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.480
I select Chaos Field.

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.350
A Field Spell?

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:07.150
And then this turn, due to Chaos Close's effect,

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:11.650
all Chaos Monsters can't attack.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.160
Shit...

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.160
Yuma, let's watch him to find a way to attack.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:18.240
Got it.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:21.370
I set one card face-down and end my turn!

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:23.830
My turn. Draw.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:27.790
As a God, my ultimate field has now been assembled.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.010
Ultimate field?

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:34.470
I activate the Field Spell from my hand, Chaos Field!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:44.020
Once per turn, this card

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:49.070
this card sends a Chaos Overlay Unit from a Chaos Xyz Monster on my field to the Graveyard

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:53.610
in order to select one random Xyz Monster from my opponent's deck at random,

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:58.080
and Special Summon them onto my field with their Monster Effects negated!

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.450
Say what?!

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.290
The Chaos Field is also known as a God Field.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:08.250
You will feel nothing but pain.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.710
And now, I'll be taking your Numbers!

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:17.300
I send one of Black Storm's Chaos Overlay Units to the Graveyard,

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.970
and I steal a Number from your Extra Deck!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:30.400
Release your anger!

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:33.900
Come forth, Number 69!

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:38.240
God Medallion - Coat of Arms!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.830
That's Tron's Ace Monster...

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.960
As it is now, he'll steal Numbers from Yuma one after another.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.920
N-No way!

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:55.340
It's too soon to be surprised.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.970
I activate Chaos Field's other effect.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:17:58.800
What?!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:02.390
the Number stolen from the opponent's Extra Deck

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:06.020
will have its rank raised and will evolve into a Chaos Xyz!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:07.020
Say what?!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:07.980
He can Chaos too?!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:14.190
I use Coat of Arms to rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:15.940
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:21.740
Come forth, Chaos Number 69!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:27.160
Death Medallion - Chaos of Arms!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.960
Coat of Arms became the enemy's Chaos Xyz!

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:40.510
Now here I go! I activate Chaos of Arms' effect!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:44.770
Once per turn, I detach one of its Chaos Overlay Units

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:49.690
in order to add one of the opposing Monster's Attack Points to my Monster's!

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:53.320
And that Monster also gains its effects!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.860
Dammit... If this attack goes through...

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.150
4000 damage!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.700
Yes, this is the end of you guys!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:07.450
Chaos of Arms, attack Hope Ray Victory!

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.580
Chaos Death Doom!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.790
Yuma, activate our Trap!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:12.580
Yeah.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:16.000
Trap, activate! Number Magic Master!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:20.840
This card releases one Number on my field

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:23.850
in order to select one Continuous Spell from my deck

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:25.760
and activate its effect!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.060
Pick Swords of Sealing Flame, Yuma!

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:32.560
Sounds good! I release Hope Ray Victory!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:39.740
And I activate the Continuous Spell, Swords of Sealing Flame from my deck!

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:45.780
When I don't have a Monster on my field, the opposing Monsters can't attack!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:54.420
It's a bit desperate, but I'll praise you
 for delaying your destruction last second.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.800
I'll set one card face-down. Turn end.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:01.130
He managed to dodge it.

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.340
But that doesn't change the bad situation Yuma and Astral are in.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:05.800
I won't lose!

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.770
My turn! Draw!

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.180
<i>This card is...!</i>

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.270
Yuma, let's use that to observe the situation.

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:14.810
Got it.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.320
I set one card and end my turn!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.900
Observe the situation?

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.280
I think you meant you can't even touch me!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.780
My turn! Draw!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:28.240
I activate Chaos Field's effect!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:32.460
I send Black Storm's effect to the Graveyard

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:37.210
and I steal one Number from your Extra Deck once again!

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:39.880
I then Special Summon it to my field!

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:48.810
Cast aside your shell of lies and
 appear forth as the God of Dragons!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.310
Number 92!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:57.110
God Dragon of False Bodies - Heart-eartH Dragon!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:05.360
Time for Chaos Field's other effect!

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:09.160
I raise the Numbers' rank and evolve it into a Chaos Number!

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:14.160
I rebuild the Overlay Network with Heart-eartH Dragon!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.540
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:23.130
Show yourself, Chaos Number 92!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:30.680
Void Dragon of Fade Bodies - Heart-eartH Chaos Dragon!

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:40.360
He turned Heart-eartH Dragon into a Chaos!

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:43.990
I activate Heart-eartH Chaos Dragon's effect!

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:47.910
Once per turn, I detach one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:53.540
and I negate the effects of the opponent's Monster, Trap, and Magic Cards until the end of the turn!

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:57.750
Also, you can't activate the effects of set cards on the field!

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.750
With that you may as well be naked.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:06.090
Astral! Yuma!

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:09.050
Now it's truly over!

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:23.650
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:26.190
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:27.400
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:28.820
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:31.700
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:34.200
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:36.750
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:37.830
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:38.870
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:42.250
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:44.590
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:47.720
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.930
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:54.890
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:56.270
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

00:22:56.270 --> 00:22:58.140
<i>Oh, oh, oh, over ray</i>

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:02.440
<i>Door's always open for you</i>

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:07.530
<i>Bring your power forth and go way, go way</i>

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:08.780
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:12.780
<i>And tears are no way, no way</i>

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:18.160
<i>With all my strength, pave way, go way</i>

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:19.370
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:23.500
<i>Got all the courage here</i>

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:25.670
<i>You ought to understand!</i>

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:27.880
<i>Go way, go way</i>

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:42.150
A heart that doesn't give up...

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:44.020
The courage to move forward no matter what.

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:48.030
The power Yuma holds to enforce one's thoughts through sheer will.

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:51.360
That is why I must protect it at all costs.

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:54.450
Even if I use up my own life to do so...

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:56.490
You think we'll lose like this?!

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:59.620
Hope, shine your aspirations down on us!

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:02.000
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.960
"Time of the End...! Bonds Entrusted to a Friend"

00:24:04.960 --> 00:24:09.630
I don't want this...! ASTRAL!
